Error [E0624]: `greeting` is declared in two files of package `package_duplicate_name`
  --> words.jet:1:4
    |
  1 | fn greeting() -> String { "hi" }
    |    ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The files of one package share one namespace, so each top-level name belongs to exactly one file; the other declaration is in `run.jet`.
 Fix: Rename one of the declarations, or keep only one of them.
